{"source": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/commits?path=docs/adr/0001-plugin-architecture.md&sha=d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960&per_page=100", "body": [{"sha": "d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960", "node_id": "C_kwDOMi-JZtoAKGQ4NWI0NzRiNDRjNjgxOGU0MWMwYjUyMjUzNjMyZGY2NjJkODM5NjA", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Viktor Petersson", "email": "self@vpetersson.com", "date": "2026-03-21T13:57:53Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Viktor Petersson", "email": "self@vpetersson.com", "date": "2026-03-21T13:57:53Z"}, "message": "Adopt adr-tools for managing Architecture Decision Records\n\nInitialize adr-tools, renumber ADRs so the standard \"Record architecture\ndecisions\" ADR is 0001, and update the plugin architecture ADR to 0002\nwith the expected Nygard format (# N. Title, Date, Status/Context/\nDecision/Consequences sections). Update references in CLAUDE.md and\nREADME.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "tree": {"sha": "9eb0419c964b6a9a55b4180cad6f3ffade48b366", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/git/trees/9eb0419c964b6a9a55b4180cad6f3ffade48b366"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/git/commits/d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgqOfkz9gU49dzNCTprpw8gZtz81\nmQG49tzFlQQmPhErUAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQCAsEXUA1BMTAnTq3YY7crAx+2/2wHTGPLoZKz9I/0IZ5lJk3SCX7NBJn4mJZysBy9\nQxiRxwm8Wxkz84yh7GTAQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----", "payload": "tree 9eb0419c964b6a9a55b4180cad6f3ffade48b366\nparent ef88b00cf107673f41063a099a9b19e3df8e3686\nauthor Viktor Petersson <self@vpetersson.com> 1774101473 +0000\ncommitter Viktor Petersson <self@vpetersson.com> 1774101473 +0000\n\nAdopt adr-tools for managing Architecture Decision Records\n\nInitialize adr-tools, renumber ADRs so the standard \"Record architecture\ndecisions\" ADR is 0001, and update the plugin architecture ADR to 0002\nwith the expected Nygard format (# N. Title, Date, Status/Context/\nDecision/Consequences sections). Update references in CLAUDE.md and\nREADME.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n", "verified_at": "2026-03-21T13:57:59Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/commits/d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960", "html_url": "https://github.com/sbomify/sbomify-action/commit/d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/commits/d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960/comments", "author": {"login": "vpetersson", "id": 357664, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzY2NA==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/357664?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson", "html_url": "https://github.com/vpetersson", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "vpetersson", "id": 357664, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzY2NA==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/357664?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson", "html_url": "https://github.com/vpetersson", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "ef88b00cf107673f41063a099a9b19e3df8e3686", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/commits/ef88b00cf107673f41063a099a9b19e3df8e3686", "html_url": "https://github.com/sbomify/sbomify-action/commit/ef88b00cf107673f41063a099a9b19e3df8e3686"}]}, {"sha": "b1bc2b828e8f5f95b7f2e1248e82462c272b1089", "node_id": "C_kwDOMi-JZtoAKGIxYmMyYjgyOGU4ZjVmOTViN2YyZTEyNDhlODI0NjJjMjcyYjEwODk", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Viktor Petersson", "email": "self@vpetersson.com", "date": "2026-01-16T16:52:01Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Viktor Petersson", "email": "self@vpetersson.com", "date": "2026-01-16T16:52:01Z"}, "message": "feat: add SBOM_FORMAT env var to support SPDX output\n\nAdd support for generating SBOMs in SPDX format via the SBOM_FORMAT\nenvironment variable. Defaults to CycloneDX for backward compatibility.\n\nChanges:\n- Add sbom_format field to Config with validation (cyclonedx|spdx)\n- Load SBOM_FORMAT from environment (case-insensitive)\n- Pass output_format to generate_sbom() and process_lock_file()\n- Add proper error handling for process_lock_file() result\n- Add 7 unit tests for format configuration\n- Update workflow to generate and attest both CDX and SPDX formats\n- Add conditionals to attestation steps for proper branch/tag handling\n- Update README with SBOM_FORMAT documentation and examples", "tree": {"sha": "5384ff01534bd0d4d43850f6a531e100e21fd4a9", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/git/trees/5384ff01534bd0d4d43850f6a531e100e21fd4a9"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/git/commits/b1bc2b828e8f5f95b7f2e1248e82462c272b1089", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg1F4CebT75AhRcY+lK9hV2EOp+L\nkuPYzrz/WmrHz72DgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQAk+fusvnKRTPs8AOqm5VRxMfcQDQpqBd4PkXYP/0LIQKBHwYHO4CdnnPTKY+/Jsgf\nh1L9PIYkeanKDuP5Vnlgc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----", "payload": "tree 5384ff01534bd0d4d43850f6a531e100e21fd4a9\nparent 72862ae9abdaf700570114e22ff4b288f8aa056a\nauthor Viktor Petersson <self@vpetersson.com> 1768582321 +0000\ncommitter Viktor Petersson <self@vpetersson.com> 1768582321 +0000\n\nfeat: add SBOM_FORMAT env var to support SPDX output\n\nAdd support for generating SBOMs in SPDX format via the SBOM_FORMAT\nenvironment variable. Defaults to CycloneDX for backward compatibility.\n\nChanges:\n- Add sbom_format field to Config with validation (cyclonedx|spdx)\n- Load SBOM_FORMAT from environment (case-insensitive)\n- Pass output_format to generate_sbom() and process_lock_file()\n- Add proper error handling for process_lock_file() result\n- Add 7 unit tests for format configuration\n- Update workflow to generate and attest both CDX and SPDX formats\n- Add conditionals to attestation steps for proper branch/tag handling\n- Update README with SBOM_FORMAT documentation and examples\n", "verified_at": "2026-01-16T16:52:10Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/commits/b1bc2b828e8f5f95b7f2e1248e82462c272b1089", "html_url": "https://github.com/sbomify/sbomify-action/commit/b1bc2b828e8f5f95b7f2e1248e82462c272b1089", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/commits/b1bc2b828e8f5f95b7f2e1248e82462c272b1089/comments", "author": {"login": "vpetersson", "id": 357664, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzY2NA==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/357664?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson", "html_url": "https://github.com/vpetersson", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "vpetersson", "id": 357664, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzY2NA==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/357664?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson", "html_url": "https://github.com/vpetersson", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "72862ae9abdaf700570114e22ff4b288f8aa056a", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/commits/72862ae9abdaf700570114e22ff4b288f8aa056a", "html_url": "https://github.com/sbomify/sbomify-action/commit/72862ae9abdaf700570114e22ff4b288f8aa056a"}]}, {"sha": "e96b3cae6452c76b1a4c3eafa6363e88219a547c", "node_id": "C_kwDOMi-JZtoAKGU5NmIzY2FlNjQ1MmM3NmIxYTRjM2VhZmE2MzYzZTg4MjE5YTU0N2M", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Viktor Petersson", "email": "self@vpetersson.com", "date": "2025-12-18T13:00:48Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Viktor Petersson", "email": "self@vpetersson.com", "date": "2025-12-18T13:00:48Z"}, "message": "Refactor SBOM generation to use plugin architecture\n\nIntroduces a modular, extensible plugin system for SBOM generation that\nreplaces the monolithic generation.py with a registry-based approach.\nThis enables better separation of concerns, easier testing, and simple\naddition of new generators in the future.\n\nKey changes:\n- New `_generation/` module with Protocol-based generator plugins\n- Priority-based generator selection (native tools preferred over generic)\n- Automatic fallback when primary generator fails\n- Built-in schema validation after generation\n- New `validation.py` module for JSON Schema validation\n- Support for output format (CycloneDX/SPDX) and version selection\n\nGenerator priorities:\n- cyclonedx-py (priority 10): Native Python, CycloneDX 1.0-1.7\n- Trivy (priority 30): All ecosystems, fixed versions (CDX 1.6, SPDX 2.3)\n- Syft (priority 35): All ecosystems, version selection support\n\nThe public API is preserved via re-exports in generation.py, ensuring\nbackward compatibility with existing code and tests.", "tree": {"sha": "9de048099a517dab0dd75c0a62070936e14e8a67", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/git/trees/9de048099a517dab0dd75c0a62070936e14e8a67"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/git/commits/e96b3cae6452c76b1a4c3eafa6363e88219a547c", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg1F4CebT75AhRcY+lK9hV2EOp+L\nkuPYzrz/WmrHz72DgAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJPnXSPI2vODmu/e9y3Df+aJ5EDapD/dF09WrGz0UzIJL2SrNZvEwYupyNW9cQGBLi\nqwzrSuuZstdCGF7KunFQs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----", "payload": "tree 9de048099a517dab0dd75c0a62070936e14e8a67\nparent 52c02685e1010e4fb00842697682280ba24b1c85\nauthor Viktor Petersson <self@vpetersson.com> 1766062848 +0000\ncommitter Viktor Petersson <self@vpetersson.com> 1766062848 +0000\n\nRefactor SBOM generation to use plugin architecture\n\nIntroduces a modular, extensible plugin system for SBOM generation that\nreplaces the monolithic generation.py with a registry-based approach.\nThis enables better separation of concerns, easier testing, and simple\naddition of new generators in the future.\n\nKey changes:\n- New `_generation/` module with Protocol-based generator plugins\n- Priority-based generator selection (native tools preferred over generic)\n- Automatic fallback when primary generator fails\n- Built-in schema validation after generation\n- New `validation.py` module for JSON Schema validation\n- Support for output format (CycloneDX/SPDX) and version selection\n\nGenerator priorities:\n- cyclonedx-py (priority 10): Native Python, CycloneDX 1.0-1.7\n- Trivy (priority 30): All ecosystems, fixed versions (CDX 1.6, SPDX 2.3)\n- Syft (priority 35): All ecosystems, version selection support\n\nThe public API is preserved via re-exports in generation.py, ensuring\nbackward compatibility with existing code and tests.\n", "verified_at": "2025-12-18T13:01:02Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/commits/e96b3cae6452c76b1a4c3eafa6363e88219a547c", "html_url": "https://github.com/sbomify/sbomify-action/commit/e96b3cae6452c76b1a4c3eafa6363e88219a547c", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/commits/e96b3cae6452c76b1a4c3eafa6363e88219a547c/comments", "author": {"login": "vpetersson", "id": 357664, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzY2NA==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/357664?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson", "html_url": "https://github.com/vpetersson", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "vpetersson", "id": 357664, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzY2NA==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/357664?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson", "html_url": "https://github.com/vpetersson", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vpetersson/events{/pr